 kw='Primary: fire escape hood (80/mo). Secondary: smoke hood (400), smoke escape hood (80, KD2), emergency escape hood (80), escape hood (60, KD0), fire smoke hood (0-10). Ricky\'s note: smoke hood (400) is the biggest term in this group; check the results page before choosing it as the primary.',
